{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "d5fcd9e124f4c09d8bef5241a601fc95c17794d338aa007535b5d95eaab756d4", "ja": "次に待つステージへ", "zh": "迈向等待着我们的下一个舞台", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6a807a86e9c9c7a1088ea3ee1d1215991e0a62e9f76e640677e89a1a717d8560", "ja": "感謝祭は大成功で幕を閉じ、片付けを\nしながらアイドル達は感慨もひとしお。\n寂しさも覚える育や琴葉だが、このみの\n言葉で前を向く。次の仕事を見据えて、\n期待に胸をふくらませるのだった。", "zh": "感恩祭在大获成功中落下帷幕，偶像们一边收拾\n一边感慨万千。\n育和琴叶虽然也感到寂寞，却在好美的话语下重新振作。\n她们展望着下一份工作，心中充满了期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "79cfb2556aa4b202279b3a654cc57091b31c73746790870627b078636d8fe010", "ja": "（感謝祭公演は、いつもより間近に感じる大歓声の中で\n幕を閉じた。……お祭りの最後は、みんなで片付けだ）", "zh": "（感謝祭公演在比平时更近在耳边的大声欢呼中落下了帷幕。……祭典的最后，当然要大家一起收拾。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "ec3b5150f902cc53d7d155c5763dda2e14606b07ad0a16fccfcacbc8717d832a", "ja": "えーと、衣装関係は分類してカバーもかけて\n美咲ちゃんに連絡済みでしょ。", "zh": "那个，服装相关的都分类整理好、套上防尘罩，也已经联系过美咲了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "11bf9cb698e57f517dd25a59e3cda7c86b07a7eab2a5a09be8f08c2fc457800f", "ja": "『STARDOM ROAD』関係の小道具も\n段ボールにしまったし……。", "zh": "“STARDOM ROAD”相关的道具也\n收进纸箱里了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "266ce8a9b126be49ef30020cf87f32f22641872c9ffe8a794528b8affeb3e2d4", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、ステージ美術はもう終わったのよね？\nこれで片付けは完了かしら。", "zh": "琴叶，舞台美术已经完成了吧？\n这样一来收拾工作就结束了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "80708241874cbb7bf35517a4f5e7583376c60937a14181c202e34ae549ddcb71", "ja": "そのはずです。{$P$}、\n最後にチェックをお願いします。", "zh": "应该是这样。{$P$}，最后请您检查一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_1005", "source_sha256": "5d5f51d1492207bd0654b72cf47c803f8be96a227ae71572f8ebcc78108ba5c2", "ja": "チェック！", "zh": "Check！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4ebd8e15458568c26d8ecc33867cc5b84a214f05b008ec8a44a8030bc0f800ef", "ja": "……うん、問題ない。\nこれにて感謝祭公演、全興行が終了だな！", "zh": "……嗯，没问题。\n至此，感谢祭公演的全部演出都结束了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2001_001har", "source_sha256": "c8b4683517a77683dd8eb53ae02712dc3b9f9e4685e1531b582b5900ee7f283f", "ja": "お疲れさまでした～！\nなんだか文化祭みたいな空気で、楽しかったね！", "zh": "辛苦了～！\n总觉得气氛就像文化祭一样，真开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "330aea526f01847604a312d5662d25e261fe9a8439a1eed063926cafd9676a90", "ja": "わたしもすっごく楽しかった！\nでも終わっちゃうと、やっぱりさみしいかな……。", "zh": "我也觉得超级开心！\n但是一结束，果然还是会觉得有点寂寞呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2003_017kth", "source_sha256": "ee08eb169fd012d7e26527e6349ed64e00d3303da6430816a323bd4687f2eb96", "ja": "次はどんな台本で、誰が誰の役をやるのか。\nいつも大騒ぎだったから……。", "zh": "下次会是什么剧本，谁来演谁呢？因为每次都热热闹闹的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2004_028ari", "source_sha256": "e99df6a03e816f12109df9ab9948d85a00515e01b516935e23f1e36b68c3591f", "ja": "はい。あの魅力的なアイドルちゃん達に、\n会えなくなると思うと……こう、胸に来るものが……。", "zh": "是的。一想到再也见不到那些魅力十足的偶像们……就觉得……心里，有种说不出的滋味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2005_039kon", "source_sha256": "51434302f61a3e7adba13384222e2c10fdcad2c3087e1f9751118744e3f7b3f7", "ja": "あら、みんなセンチメンタルね？\n確かに、アイドル達の物語がひとつ、終わったけど。", "zh": "哎呀，大家都很伤感呢？\n确实，偶像们的故事有一个结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2006_039kon", "source_sha256": "27652018a18b79c330da5cd184bfed94ce871f3d85c20b2d813ce2bd17b75d2e", "ja": "明日からは新しいアイドルのお話が始まるのよ！\n劇場での毎日が、私達の物語なんだから♪", "zh": "从明天开始，就要讲述新的偶像故事了！\n剧场里的每一天，都是我们的故事呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2007_001har", "source_sha256": "f890eb2a3cbeb3c403744ffa92868e6eac280cd7d79d4addf8d32d1a7d8f3268", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですよね！　気が早いかもですけど、\n次の公演もすぐに始まるだろうし！", "zh": "呵呵，说得对呢！虽然现在想这个可能还早了点，\n但下一场公演应该也很快就要开始了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2008_030iku", "source_sha256": "a9900784a7d8dcb3fa897ab88ab5472e3d9d37456a4b3131218c85659641f21c", "ja": "次の公演かぁ……どんななんだろう？\n楽しみだなぁ～！", "zh": "下次公演啊……会是什么样的呢？\n真期待啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2009_017kth", "source_sha256": "16de5447b8e4c2ce0ebdd19d237379db45b129bba6d72f38770d316bfd4b08fa", "ja": "今なら、どんな公演でも挑戦できそうな気がします！", "zh": "我觉得现在无论是什么样的公演，都可以挑战一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2010_028ari", "source_sha256": "15506be90a43e6b694daba5b7a5f2bf3836795dce79cc0dc8fa6ef3ea7529ace", "ja": "ムフフ♪　アイドルちゃんの可能性は無限大……。\nありさ、いくらでもアイディアを出しますよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　偶像们的可能性无限大……  \n亚利沙可以想出无穷无尽的点子哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2011_p", "source_sha256": "ae5e07471724a3a301961eff38d00928a1908ff0c7f457409e0519ef25539c88", "ja": "まあ、今日一日くらいは英気を養ってくれ。\nとりあえず、フィナーレの後といえば……。", "zh": "哎，今天至少好好休养一下吧。\n说到闭幕演出之后，首先想到的就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_06_2012_p", "source_sha256": "98d335799ae6d756639c30832f65bf9297b82d6bf34a446e9679271cd3ed3cae", "ja": "みんなで打ち上げだ！\nさあ、移動するぞ！", "zh": "大家一起去庆功宴吧！\n来，出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
